@startuml Preciazo_Route_Planning_States
title Preciazo - Route Planning Lifecycle (AV2 Proposal)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
[*] --> OPTIMIZED : Successful generation
OPTIMIZED --> CONFIRMED : Buyer confirms; valid plan and current version
OPTIMIZED --> OPTIMIZED : Successful recalculation
CONFIRMED --> OPTIMIZED : Successful recalculation; requires confirmation again
note bottom of OPTIMIZED
  Failed generation creates no persisted route.
  Failed recalculation/confirmation leaves the previous plan and version intact.
  INCOMPLETE basket coverage prevents confirmation.
  A standalone itinerary has NOT_EVALUATED basket coverage and no savings claim.
end note
note bottom of CONFIRMED
  Confirmation does not reserve stock or guarantee future opening/traffic.
  Current validation is a query; discovered issues are shown to the buyer.
  Replanning is an explicit buyer command, not an implicit query side effect.
end note
@enduml
